# Smart Crop Recommendation System 🌱

## Overview

This project recommends the most suitable crop based on soil nutrients and weather conditions using Machine Learning.

## Features

- Data Analysis with Pandas
- Data Visualization with Matplotlib
- Logistic Regression
- Decision Tree
- Random Forest
- Feature Importance Analysis
- Interactive Streamlit Web App

## Dataset Features

- Nitrogen (N)
- Phosphorus (P)
- Potassium (K)
- Temperature
- Humidity
- pH
- Rainfall

## Model Performance

| Model | Accuracy |
|---------|---------|
| Logistic Regression | 94.5% |
| Decision Tree | 98.6% |
| Random Forest | 99.3% |

## Technologies

- Python
- Pandas
- NumPy
- Matplotlib
- Scikit-Learn
- Streamlit
- Joblib

## Run Locally

```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
streamlit run app/app.py
```

